-- Goal: Pass south of Tuckburrow (Distance: 3626)
UPDATE goals SET description = 'The travellers make their way westward through the Shire, passing near the Green Hill Country and skirting the rolling boundaries of the Tookland. As they ride south of Tuckburrow, the ancestral seat of the Thains where Peregrin''s family dwells, the land appears lush and peaceful, fully recovered from the ruin of Sharkey''s rule. Yet Frodo moves through these beloved fields with a quiet detachment, knowing that for him, the saving of the Shire has not brought personal peace. Their journey carries them steadily away from the heart of the hobbit-lands towards the White Downs and the final road to the Sea.' WHERE distance = 3626 * 1.60934;

