-- Goal: Reach the crest of the Far Downs (Distance: 3669)
UPDATE goals SET description = 'Frodo and his companions rode steadily westward, ascending until they attained the high crest of the Far Downs. Before the travellers lay a wide expanse of grassy lowlands, silent and nearly uninhabited, rolling away towards the distant sea. Upon the western horizon, the ancient white towers of the Tower Hills gleamed pale against the sky, marking the boundary of the Elven lands. The air here tasted faintly of salt, carrying the first breath of the Sea to meet the Ring-bearer on his final journey.' WHERE distance = 3669 * 1.60934;
